    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d769">

                <pb facs="0886" n="801" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg801"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">816.48/75: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Salvador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Arnold</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-04-28T17:00:00-05:56"><hi rendition="#italic">April 28, 1919,
                                5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received April 29,
                            12.30 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Martial law declared today. Damage much greater than first anticipated. Number of
                    deaths at present reported 40 persons. Notify Weinberg’s parents Washington he
                    is safe.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Arnold</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
